<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - FarmaSalud</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.datatables.net/1.13.6/css/dataTables.bootstrap5.min.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --brand-emerald: #064e3b; /* Verde esmeralda profundo */
            --brand-light: #f0fdf4;
            --brand-accent: #10b981;
            --admin-footer-bg: #f1f5f9;
            --sidebar-width: 280px;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* --- ADMIN: SIDEBAR --- */
        #sidebar-admin {
            width: var(--sidebar-width);
            height: 100vh;
            background: #ffffff;
            position: fixed;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1050;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .admin-brand {
            padding: 30px 24px;
            background: var(--brand-emerald);
            color: white;
        }

        .admin-nav-item {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            margin: 4px 16px;
            color: #475569;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 8px !important;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

            .admin-nav-item:hover {
                background: var(--brand-light);
                color: var(--brand-emerald);
            }

        /* --- CLIENTE: NAVBAR PROFESIONAL --- */
        .navbar-premium {
            background: var(--brand-emerald);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            border-bottom: 4px solid var(--brand-accent);
        }

        .nav-link-custom {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85) !important;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem !important;
        }

            .nav-link-custom:hover {
                color: #fff !important;
            }

        /* --- ESTRUCTURA DE CONTENIDO --- */
        #main-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            margin-left: @(User.IsInRole("Admin") || User.IsInRole("SuperAdmin") ? "var(--sidebar-width)" : "0");
            padding-top: @(User.IsInRole("Admin") || User.IsInRole("SuperAdmin") ? "30px" : "100px");
        }

        /* --- FOOTERS MEJORADOS --- */
        .footer-admin {
            background: var(--admin-footer-bg);
            padding: 15px 40px;
            margin-left: var(--sidebar-width);
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .footer-client {
            background: #0f172a; /* Azul noche muy oscuro */
            color: #94a3b8;
            padding: 70px 0 30px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }

        /* EL TRUCO DEL 80% PARA QUE NO SE VEA APLASTADO */
        .footer-constrained {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .footer-client h5 {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .dev-badge {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--brand-accent);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .btn-modern {
            border-radius: 0 !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    @if (User.Identity.IsAuthenticated && (User.IsInRole("Admin") || User.IsInRole("SuperAdmin")))
    {
        <nav id="sidebar-admin">
            <div class="admin-brand text-center">
                <h4 class="fw-bold m-0 text-white">FARMA SALUD</h4>
                <small class="opacity-75">SISTEMA INTERNO</small>
            </div>
            <div class="py-4 flex-grow-1">
                <a class="admin-nav-item" asp-controller="Admin" asp-action="Dashboard"><i class="bi bi-speedometer2 me-3"></i> Dashboard</a>
                <a class="admin-nav-item" asp-controller="MedicamentosAdmin" asp-action="Index"><i class="bi bi-box-seam me-3"></i> Inventario</a>
                <a class="admin-nav-item" asp-controller="Categorias" asp-action="Index"><i class="bi bi-tags me-3"></i> Categorías</a>
                <a class="admin-nav-item" asp-controller="Usuarios" asp-action="Index"><i class="bi bi-people me-3"></i> Usuarios</a>
                <a class="admin-nav-item" asp-controller="Medicamento" asp-action="Catalogo"><i class="bi bi-people me-3"></i> Catálogo</a>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 border-top">
                <form asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post" id="logoutAdmin"></form>
                <button onclick="document.getElementById('logoutAdmin').submit()" class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100 btn-modern">SALIR PANEL</button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    }
    else
    {
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark navbar-premium fixed-top">
            <div class="container">
                <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold fs-3" asp-controller="Medicamento" asp-action="Catalogo">
                    <i class="bi bi-plus-square-fill me-2 text-accent"></i>FARMA SALUD
                </a>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-center">
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" asp-controller="Medicamento" asp-action="Catalogo">PRODUCTOS</a></li>
                        @if (User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" asp-controller="Carrito" asp-action="Index">CARRITO</a></li>
                            <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" asp-controller="Reserva" asp-action="MisReservas">MIS PEDIDOS</a></li>
                            <li class="nav-item ms-3">
                                <form asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post" id="logoutCli"></form>
                                <button onclick="document.getElementById('logoutCli').submit()" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm btn-modern px-3">SALIR</button>
                            </li>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item ms-3">
                                <a class="btn btn-light text-success btn-modern px-4" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">INGRESAR</a>
                            </li>
                        }
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    }

    <div id="main-wrapper">
        <main role="main" class="container-fluid px-lg-5">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>

    @if (User.Identity.IsAuthenticated && (User.IsInRole("Admin") || User.IsInRole("SuperAdmin")))
    {
        <footer class="footer-admin d-flex justify-content-between">
            <span>&copy; 2026 <b>FarmaSalud</b> | Trujillo - Perú</span>
            <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="letter-spacing: 1px;">Admin Mode</span>
        </footer>
    }
    else
    {
        <footer class="footer-client">
            <div class="footer-constrained">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-5 mb-5">
                        <h5 class="text-success">FARMA SALUD</h5>
                        <p class="pe-lg-5">Soluciones farmacéuticas de alta calidad con entrega inmediata en todo Trujillo. Tu salud es nuestra prioridad.</p>
                        <div class="mt-4 small">
                            <p class="mb-1"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt me-2 text-success"></i> Sede Central: Av. Larco 1230, Trujillo</p>
                            <p><i class="bi bi-clock me-2 text-success"></i> Atención: Lun - Dom | 24 Horas</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-4 mb-5">
                        <h5>DESARROLLO POR</h5>
                        <div class="dev-badge">
                            <span class="d-block fw-bold text-white">Luis Alonso Alvarado</span>
                            <small>Estudiante de Informatica</small>
                        </div>
                        <div class="dev-badge">
                            <span class="d-block fw-bold text-white">Johan Navarro</span>
                            <small>Estudiante de Informatica</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-3 mb-5 text-lg-end">
                        <h5>CONTACTO</h5>
                        <p class="mb-1 fw-bold text-white">soporte@farmasalud.pe</p>
                        <p class="small">Central: (044) 204060</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="border-top border-secondary mt-4 pt-4 text-center small">
                    &copy; 2026 FarmaSalud Trujillo. Todos los derechos reservados.
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    }

    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.datatables.net/1.13.6/js/jquery.dataTables.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.datatables.net/1.13.6/js/dataTables.bootstrap5.min.js"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
